1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:48,720 --> 00:01:52,290
3 years later

25
00:01:53,760 --> 00:01:54,890
Senior,

26
00:01:54,960 --> 00:01:56,610
I’m leaving seclusion.

27
00:01:57,240 --> 00:01:58,850
You don't have to worry,

28
00:01:59,040 --> 00:02:01,040
I have memorized the Underworld Ascension Method

29
00:02:00,840 --> 00:02:03,880
and the technique to locate extreme Yin energy gathering spots.

30
00:02:03,800 --> 00:02:06,240
I will find a suitable place to cultivate.

31
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:09,650
I’m sorry for dragging you into this.

32
00:02:09,520 --> 00:02:10,880
When you helped me,

33
00:02:10,640 --> 00:02:12,600
you used too much of your Origin Soul's energy.

34
00:02:13,160 --> 00:02:15,730
If you hadn't, you wouldn't be in this state.

35
00:02:15,720 --> 00:02:17,450
I will form my Golden Core.

36
00:02:17,280 --> 00:02:18,080
Wait for me.

37
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:23,410
You will wake up,

38
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:24,250
right ?

39
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:36,040
It's been 100 years...

40
00:02:36,200 --> 00:02:38,920
Master...

41
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:42,440
you abandoned your corpse last time.

42
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:44,640
But this time,

43
00:02:45,080 --> 00:02:47,720
you won’t escape !

44
00:02:45,880 --> 00:02:47,890
Zi Daren
Wu Yu's Corpse Puppet
Middle stage Nascent Soul

45
00:02:50,880 --> 00:02:53,290
The Yin energy is dense here.

46
00:02:57,200 --> 00:02:59,770
Village ruins

47
00:03:08,720 --> 00:03:10,640
Steamed buns for sale !

48
00:03:18,880 --> 00:03:20,330
Scram !

49
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:51,250
It was destroyed in a single night

50
00:03:51,040 --> 00:03:55,190
and an extreme Yin energy gathering spot was created by these countless deaths...

51
00:03:52,640 --> 00:03:56,370
Grade 1
Underworld Yin

52
00:04:19,960 --> 00:04:22,130
The maze formation is complete.

53
00:04:36,280 --> 00:04:39,760
The Underworld Ascension Method has 9 layers.

54
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:41,880
Every 3 layers requires you

55
00:04:41,640 --> 00:04:46,360
to open the meridians for the Dantian, Qi Sea, and the ancestral meridian.

56
00:04:46,560 --> 00:04:48,890
This is called meridian awakening.

57
00:04:48,880 --> 00:04:50,680
The success rate of meridian awakening

58
00:04:50,520 --> 00:04:53,800
is heavily influenced by the quality of the Yin energy.

59
00:04:54,960 --> 00:04:56,720
When a meridian awakening succeeds,

60
00:04:56,480 --> 00:04:58,610
a Cold Core will be condensed.

61
00:04:58,520 --> 00:05:00,050
With that Cold Core,

62
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:03,080
your spiritual energy will become cold spiritual energy.

63
00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:06,520
Finally, by merging the 3 Cold Cores,

64
00:05:06,280 --> 00:05:09,800
you will have a chance to reach Core Formation directly.

65
00:05:25,080 --> 00:05:27,770
Adai
Late stage Foundation Establishment

66
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:35,130
Who dares to trespass ?

67
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:56,930
Still not leaving ?

68
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:14,810
You're courting death !

69
00:06:27,440 --> 00:06:28,200
Shit !

70
00:06:29,840 --> 00:06:31,610
I can’t retrieve it...

71
00:06:51,360 --> 00:06:53,250
What kind of technique is this ?

72
00:06:53,880 --> 00:06:56,290
Its healing effect is extraordinary...

73
00:06:59,520 --> 00:07:01,210
Who are you ?

74
00:07:01,280 --> 00:07:02,800
If you leave now

75
00:07:02,880 --> 00:07:04,690
and stop interrupting my cultivation,

76
00:07:04,440 --> 00:07:06,360
I’ll let this matter slide.

77
00:07:08,960 --> 00:07:10,880
Now stay out of my way.

78
00:07:10,960 --> 00:07:12,120
And if you don't,

79
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:13,320
I will destroy you.

80
00:07:28,320 --> 00:07:30,000
You mean this formation ?

81
00:07:49,280 --> 00:07:51,440
The talismans on this guy's body are weird.

82
00:07:51,600 --> 00:07:53,920
I must avoid conflict...

83
00:07:55,160 --> 00:07:56,770
You’re courting death !

84
00:08:06,400 --> 00:08:08,970
Thousand Illusions Bead

85
00:08:08,200 --> 00:08:09,730
This is an artifact !

86
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:14,040
Core Formation ?

87
00:08:14,840 --> 00:08:16,010
This is…

88
00:08:16,160 --> 00:08:18,010
an illusion artifact.

89
00:08:32,320 --> 00:08:33,480
Nascent Soul !

90
00:08:37,080 --> 00:08:39,330
These illusions are very realistic.

91
00:08:39,280 --> 00:08:41,980
The more spiritual energy flows into the bead,

92
00:08:41,960 --> 00:08:44,210
the higher the illusory cultivation level becomes.

93
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:46,050
It's difficult to see through it

94
00:08:45,920 --> 00:08:47,320
so it's perfect

95
00:08:47,520 --> 00:08:49,170
for intimidation.

96
00:08:50,880 --> 00:08:52,560
This guy is weird

97
00:08:52,880 --> 00:08:54,930
for trading such an artifact

98
00:08:54,800 --> 00:08:56,920
against a minor maze formation.

99
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:59,490
I should find a better cultivation spot.

100
00:09:06,880 --> 00:09:09,050
Grade 5
Underworld Yin

101
00:09:11,560 --> 00:09:13,570
This place is different,

102
00:09:13,560 --> 00:09:16,340
the Yin energy is far denser than elsewhere.

103
00:09:21,880 --> 00:09:23,440
Begin meridian awakening !

104
00:09:30,600 --> 00:09:32,770
Wang Lin doesn’t know that

105
00:09:32,560 --> 00:09:34,470
his spiritual energy

106
00:09:34,240 --> 00:09:38,210
is being affected by the extreme Yin conditions

107
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:41,530
and is slowly evolving towards the Ji Realm.

108
00:09:41,280 --> 00:09:43,450
The main reason this is happening

109
00:09:43,200 --> 00:09:47,040
is that the Underworld Ascension Method

110
00:09:47,200 --> 00:09:50,240
is one of the rare techniques

111
00:09:50,160 --> 00:09:54,080
capable of cultivating Ji Realm spiritual energy.

112
00:10:18,600 --> 00:10:20,770
In the Underworld Ascension Method,

113
00:10:20,600 --> 00:10:22,970
each meridian awakening gets more difficult.

114
00:10:22,920 --> 00:10:26,810
I must find an even better extreme Yin energy gathering spot.

115
00:10:42,160 --> 00:10:43,730
It's been a century,

116
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:46,360
I never thought you’d gain sentience.

117
00:10:46,720 --> 00:10:48,400
I can spare you

118
00:10:48,800 --> 00:10:52,010
but you will have to use your bond with Master

119
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:54,640
to help me locate his Nascent Soul.

120
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:57,480
Let’s go,

121
00:10:57,240 --> 00:10:58,440
take me to him.

122
00:10:59,120 --> 00:11:02,000
If you can find Master’s Nascent Soul,

123
00:11:01,920 --> 00:11:05,040
I’ll devour it and gain my freedom.

124
00:11:04,880 --> 00:11:09,040
And you might evolve into a Corpse Demon.

125
00:11:30,920 --> 00:11:32,130
Grade 2
Underworld Yin

126
00:11:31,480 --> 00:11:33,570
It's still Underworld Yin level...

127
00:11:39,240 --> 00:11:41,250
You’ve been following me this whole time,

128
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:42,850
what do you want ?

129
00:11:48,040 --> 00:11:50,210
Do you want me to follow you ?

130
00:13:32,240 --> 00:13:33,490
This statue

131
00:13:33,240 --> 00:13:34,960
looks like it's alive.

132
00:13:47,520 --> 00:13:50,170
Grade 10
Underworld Yin

133
00:13:48,640 --> 00:13:50,930
This extreme Yin energy gathering spot

134
00:13:50,840 --> 00:13:52,730
is Grade 10 Underworld Yin !

135
00:14:00,640 --> 00:14:04,210
5 days later

136
00:14:12,640 --> 00:14:16,200
I have already mastered the 5th layer of the Underworld Ascension Method.

137
00:14:59,560 --> 00:15:01,960
I have found you...

138
00:15:26,760 --> 00:15:28,810
Young friend, don’t act rashly.

139
00:15:28,640 --> 00:15:31,090
This old man means no harm.

140
00:15:44,520 --> 00:15:45,560
Adai,

141
00:15:46,280 --> 00:15:48,610
don’t be rude to our guest.

142
00:15:45,880 --> 00:15:48,650
Wu Yu's Nascent Soul

143
00:15:52,320 --> 00:15:53,810
Master...

144
00:15:53,840 --> 00:15:56,680
It's been 100 years...

145
00:15:57,200 --> 00:15:58,760
But this time,

146
00:15:59,240 --> 00:16:01,610
you won’t escape.

147
00:16:05,680 --> 00:16:06,880
Who is he ?

148
00:16:06,840 --> 00:16:08,410
Are you his master ?

149
00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:10,650
He's my Corpse Puppet.

150
00:16:12,720 --> 00:16:15,360
I'm an Ancestor of the Corpse Sect of Zhao.

151
00:16:15,120 --> 00:16:17,600
All disciples of the Corpse Sect

152
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:19,960
must find a corpse to refine into

153
00:16:19,760 --> 00:16:21,610
their Corpse Puppet.

154
00:16:21,480 --> 00:16:23,490
As cultivation increases,

155
00:16:23,320 --> 00:16:26,080
the Corpse Puppet will get stronger.

156
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:28,250
Your Corpse Puppet rebelled ?

157
00:16:28,800 --> 00:16:29,840
Yes...

158
00:16:30,280 --> 00:16:33,280
300 years ago, when I came here,

159
00:16:33,160 --> 00:16:35,680
my Corpse Puppet was influenced by the Yin energy,

160
00:16:35,720 --> 00:16:37,200
escaped my control

161
00:16:37,040 --> 00:16:38,600
and attacked me.

162
00:16:39,640 --> 00:16:43,160
The other one is my former corpse

163
00:16:43,560 --> 00:16:46,320
that has somehow gained sentience...

164
00:16:47,960 --> 00:16:50,680
I really need your help, young friend.

165
00:16:50,880 --> 00:16:52,440
I can use a secret technique

166
00:16:52,200 --> 00:16:55,000
to open a teleportation formation

167
00:16:54,760 --> 00:16:57,560
directly to the Corpse Sect.

168
00:16:58,680 --> 00:17:01,010
If you can activate a teleportation formation,

169
00:17:00,760 --> 00:17:02,930
then why are you still here ?

170
00:17:03,760 --> 00:17:07,160
I must not go further than 100 li away from my corpse

171
00:17:03,760 --> 00:17:07,160
Note: 1 li = 150m

172
00:17:07,120 --> 00:17:09,080
or my weak Nascent Soul

173
00:17:08,840 --> 00:17:11,680
might dissipate.

174
00:17:12,600 --> 00:17:16,920
I beg you, find my Senior Brother Ye Zizai and ask him to rescue me.

175
00:17:48,520 --> 00:17:50,080
Adai told me that

176
00:17:49,840 --> 00:17:51,920
you cultivate with Yin energy.

177
00:17:51,680 --> 00:17:54,520
The Corpse Sect has secluded cultivation caves

178
00:17:56,160 --> 00:17:58,760
with Earth-level Yin energy.

179
00:17:59,080 --> 00:18:00,130
Young friend,

180
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:02,160
I’ll activate the formation now.

181
00:18:04,680 --> 00:18:06,290
It's now up to you

182
00:18:06,040 --> 00:18:07,760
to decide what you do !

183
00:18:08,400 --> 00:18:10,560
The Corpse Puppet is clearly bloodthirsty...

184
00:18:10,960 --> 00:18:12,400
If I don’t leave now,

185
00:18:12,280 --> 00:18:13,600
I’ll be in danger

186
00:18:13,760 --> 00:18:15,160
when that guy breaks in.

187
00:18:15,840 --> 00:18:16,930
Agreed.

188
00:18:27,200 --> 00:18:31,640
Master, this time you won’t escape !

189
00:18:41,080 --> 00:20:43,210
As you may know, Daoism is not an exact science and you don't need to understand any of the inner working of chinese internal alchemy.

All you need to know is that to reach Core Formation Wang Lin needs to absorb Yin energy, condense 3 Cold Cores and fuse them together to make a Golden Core.

Underworld Yin < Earth Yin

The Ji Realm will be explained later.

"To go into seclusion" is to isolate oneself for cultivation, recover from injuries, refine artifacts, etc...

For the curious:
There are 3 Dantian in the body located in the head, the heart and the lower abdomen (the 3 spots mentioned by the Underworld Ascension Method but with different names). In general, the Dantian is the location where spiritual energy is stored and is where cultivation happens (where a foundation is built to house a Golden Core, a Nascent Soul, an Origin Soul, etc...).
Feel free to dig up that rabbit hole on your own if you want.

190
00:18:46,560 --> 00:18:52,450
I've been walking this path for endless years

191
00:18:49,210 --> 00:18:52,450
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

192
00:18:52,840 --> 00:18:58,050
Is it the compass of fate

193
00:18:54,680 --> 00:18:58,050
that wrote this outcome for us ?

194
00:18:57,960 --> 00:19:03,970
The heavens want to erase your existence,

195
00:19:03,840 --> 00:19:09,690
that's the obsession guiding me.

196
00:19:09,720 --> 00:19:15,290
Is this the path to uncover

197
00:19:11,600 --> 00:19:15,290
truths from falsehoods ?

198
00:19:15,320 --> 00:19:20,890
In a world of murk and shadow,

199
00:19:17,220 --> 00:19:20,890
only the flame of truth can light the way.

200
00:19:20,680 --> 00:19:26,610
Look at them all,

201
00:19:23,560 --> 00:19:26,610
being carried by the waves.

202
00:19:26,800 --> 00:19:31,250
Look at them all,

203
00:19:28,960 --> 00:19:31,250
being drowned.

204
00:19:31,080 --> 00:19:34,570
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

205
00:19:34,360 --> 00:19:37,650
I will let the world refine my soul.

206
00:19:37,530 --> 00:19:43,210
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

207
00:19:39,220 --> 00:19:43,210
I will fight.

208
00:19:42,960 --> 00:19:46,330
I'll break through the abyss of despair

209
00:19:46,080 --> 00:19:49,370
to finally learn who I really am.

210
00:19:49,120 --> 00:19:54,730
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

211
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:54,730
I embrace this obsession.

212
00:19:54,480 --> 00:19:57,690
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

213
00:19:57,440 --> 00:20:00,490
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

214
00:20:00,240 --> 00:20:05,970
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

215
00:20:02,280 --> 00:20:05,970
I'll still fight.

216
00:20:05,920 --> 00:20:09,330
It's hard to avoid loneliness

217
00:20:09,080 --> 00:20:12,370
when you are above everyone else.

218
00:20:12,120 --> 00:20:18,050
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

219
00:20:14,440 --> 00:20:18,050
be afraid of a firefly ?
